{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-dressed-particle-examples","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Example","doco:Section"],"label":"ex:dressed-particle-examples","kind":"example","title":"Dressing bare nuclei to neutral atoms","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-dressed-particle"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-dressed-particle","tags":["dressing","shell","atom","noble-gas","example"],"text":"dressed-particle-examples.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"ex:dressed-particle-examples\"></a>\n<strong>Example.</strong> <em>Dressing bare nuclei to neutral atoms</em></p>\n<p><strong>Examples.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Bare proton <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{dress}_{[1s^1]}}</code> neutral hydrogen <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">{}^1\\mathrm{H}</code>.</em></li>\n<li><em>Bare <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">^4</code>He-nucleus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{dress}_{[1s^2]}}</code> neutral helium (noble gas, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Z = 2</code>).</em></li>\n<li><em>Bare <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">^{20}</code>Ne-nucleus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{dress}_{[1s^2 2s^2 2p^6]}}</code> neutral neon (noble gas, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Z = 10</code>).</em></li>\n</ul>\n"}
